OpenShift administration training (Ambient IT, 3 days, program targets OCP 4.17)
Page: content/Trainings/openshift-administration.{en,fr}.md

Missing labs (by priority)
- Day 3: StatefulSet rolling update lab on kind, follow-up of the mongo lab: reverse ordinal order, partition canary, OnDelete, rollback keeps PVCs, stuck rollout on a non-Ready pod
- Day 3: trainer demo on the Azure IPI cluster: CloudNativePG from OperatorHub, rolling update with primary switchover (why an operator beats a raw StatefulSet)
- Day 3: ephemeral containers: use https://kubernetes.io/docs/tasks/debug/debug-application/debug-running-pod/#ephemeral-container (linked on the page); optionally add `oc debug` pod and node
- Day 2: monitoring: trainer demo on the shared Azure IPI cluster console (Prometheus, Thanos Querier); optional: enableUserWorkload + ServiceMonitor for app metrics
- Day 2: operators with OLM: install an operator from OperatorHub (Subscription, InstallPlan, CSV); OperatorSDK hello-world (demo only)
- Day 2: MachineSet lab written (1_Labs/openshift-machineset.en.md, from OPENSHIFT.pdf slide 21 and openshift-advanced/infra/az/machineset): TEST it on the Azure IPI cluster; check Azure vCPU quota (1 Standard_D4s_v3 per trainee) and zone assignment per trainee
- Day 1: DeploymentConfig -> Deployment migration lab (image.openshift.io/triggers annotation)

Missing or outdated slides
- DeploymentConfig: none; one slide "deprecated since 4.14, how to migrate"
- OpenShift monitoring stack: platform vs user workload, Thanos Querier in openshift-monitoring (D_05 is generic Thanos)
- D_03_Prometheus_monitoring.pdf dates from 2019, refresh or replace
- Stateful app best practices on OpenShift: StorageClass, PDB, anti-affinity, probes, non-root images
- OLM / OperatorHub (E_06 covers CRD + Operator SDK only)
- Progressive delivery: Route weights, Argo Rollouts (OpenShift GitOps)
- OPENSHIFT.pdf converted to slides/OPENSHIFT.md (Marp, 2026-10-21): typo, SDN/OVN text and docs.openshift.com links (now docs.okd.io) fixed, Sparks logo gone; old Google Slides PDF in static/pdf is overridden by slides/OPENSHIFT.pdf at publish time
- Slides: remove the Sparks logo (client logo, bottom right) from the other Google Slides decks in static/pdf
- Optional CI module: Jenkins is deprecated on OpenShift, use OpenShift Pipelines (Tekton)

Infra
- Trainees: one Scaleway VM each with kind (3 workers), plus one shared OpenShift IPI cluster on Azure (created by the trainer). Check the VPA operator is installed on it
